          "source": "pipeOwners",
          "language": "jq"
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "C 每次绑定一个任务，让当前输入继续保留整份数据。[](source:bindJobs)",
          "id": "prose-5c81e638540e"
        },
